    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "I do not have information on our pricing model or current financial position, so I cannot provide a projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, considering The client's requirement for controlled annual operating costs, our can propose cost-optimisation strategies such as right-sizing the infrastructure to match usage patterns and leveraging our partnership with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, to ensure efficient resource allocation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure, our can highlight that our solution is hosted on OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider SecNumCloud-qualified and HDS-certified infrastructure, which implies adherence to certain environmental standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, as part of our joint research programme with a French public AI research laboratory, our can explore opportunities for retrieval-augmented generation and explainability that may lead to more energy-efficient AI models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, I do not have specific information on the exact measures or impact on carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: response time below 2 seconds, high availability including outside office hours (24/7 services), API integration with The client existing information systems and user directories, hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be evaluated as follows:  Response time below 2 seconds is FULLY COVERED because the common queries p95 latency is below 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability including outside office hours is FULLY COVERED since our operate 24/7 on the appropriate hosting tier with active-active redundancy across two availability zones and an availability target of 99.9 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with The client existing information systems and user directories is FULLY COVERED as our platform supports API-first design, including REST and webhook, and integrates with various identity providers such as SAML, OIDC, LDAP, and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU is FULLY COVERED because our offer hosting options on the Sovereign HDS tier through OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and operates only within the EU using renewable power." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers is FULLY COVERED if our opt for our sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, as our sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud does not rely on any non-European providers. the proposed architecture would involve deploying our Atelier platform on the Sovereign HDS tier, utilizing the European open-weight model to ensure sovereignty and compliance with the EU regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup would allow for 24/7 operations, integrate seamlessly with The client existing systems via APIs, and maintain response times below 2 seconds while ensuring high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement to ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of health data, and how will we guarantee compliance with the GDPR and French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of health data and guarantee compliance with GDPR and French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, we already has in place several key security controls." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption, we use TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest. we also implement pseudonymisation where applicable. we hosting infrastructure is operated on OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensuring EU-only data hosting with no transfer outside EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and auditability, we product Atelier supports grounded-in-sources explanations, retrieval trace, and an audit log, allowing for a posteriori review. our product Atelier also supports medical confidentiality and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that no decision is automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional, we follow strict segregation of duties between development and production operations and have defined incident response steps in place. we existing certifications include ISO 27001 and French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, with HDS certification specifically covering health data hosting through OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud. we also comply with GDPR Art. 28 as outlined in we Data Processing Agreement (DPA)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we have a Data Protection Officer appointed and maintain a data processing register. we secure software development life cycle includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further guarantee compliance with GDPR and HDS, we will continue to adhere to we established frameworks for familiarity, including CNIL guidance and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare, ensuring explainability aspects such as human oversight and source traceability are maintained. we control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, with audit evidence available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With these measures in place, we is well-positioned to meet the requirements of The tender regarding GDPR compliance and HDS certification for the handling of health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements, including GDPR, French law, and medical responsibility?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, I can identify potential legal risks related to GDPR compliance, explainability and auditability of AI outputs, and automated decision-making. we have experience with GDPR obligations, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements, which is relevant for handling sensitive health data. we Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription model, and we use permissive licenses for open-source components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's crucial to ensure that we AI models, including the sovereign European open-weight model and any proprietary third-party models, comply with GDPR requirements, particularly regarding data processing and transfer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for explainability and auditability of AI outputs, we should review Our Atelier platform capabilities to provide transparent and interpretable results, ensuring that all decisions can be traced back and validated by an authorized professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Automated decision-making without explicit validation may pose significant risks, and we must guarantee that Our Atelier platform allows for human oversight and approval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, French law, and medical responsibility, we generally maintain a good level of compliance. we Security & Compliance function monitors obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in health contexts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, I would recommend conducting a thorough review to confirm that we specific implementation meets all the tender's strict requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In particular, we should verify that we data hosting is indeed limited to EU-only, with no transfers outside EU, and that encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data are properly implemented where applicable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we must ensure that we medical device threshold handling is adequate, flagging any potential CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while we have a solid foundation in terms of regulatory compliance, it's essential to conduct a detailed assessment to identify any potential gaps or risks and confirm we compliance with The tender specific requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with The client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires a pilot phase followed by progressive rollout." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose? our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25 to 35 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contract, our need to consider the breakdown of costs within the €900,000 budget envelope." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is divided into one-off project costs, which account for 30 percent of The client's global budget, and recurring run costs, which make up 70 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One-off project costs are estimated at 30% of €900,000, which equals €270,000, and One-off project costs will be incurred over the first 18 months." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Recurring run costs account for 70% of The client's global budget, amounting to €630,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and the cost structure, our can aim to maintain a gross margin within our target range by carefully managing the recurring run costs, particularly hosting and inference costs, which are the main drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimisation strategies, favouring configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability is key. our can propose using the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, as the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model have been noted to be more cost-efficient on the recurring side compared to the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference. using will help in maintaining an acceptable margin while staying within the client's budget envelope." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By working closely with the architect and utilizing our five-year cost model, our can ensure that the proposed configuration aligns with the client's budgetary constraints and our financial goals, allowing for flexibility if requirements or budgets change during the contract period." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How will we design the AI components to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy can we propose to improve the efficiency of staff and the quality of care delivered to patients?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, we will design the AI components based on we Retrieval-augmented generation approach, which grounds answers in the organisation's own validated documents. design will ensure that an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities provides accurate and relevant information to hospital staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will be embedded into hospital staff existing work environment and tools, avoiding disruption to clinical or administrative workflows. we iterative approach will involve corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable we to tailor the AI components to the specific needs of the hospital staff and continuously improve The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the efficiency of staff and the quality of care delivered to patients, we propose an innovation strategy that focuses on augmenting existing workflows with AI-driven assistance. we solution will provide features such as template-guided drafting, applicable rules recall, and dossier-context continuity, which will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we experience from previous use cases, such as the medical-documentation pilot for a regional hospital group, we can adapt we solution to meet the specific requirements of the hospital. we approach will prioritize explainability, sovereignty, and human oversight, ensuring that the AI components are transparent, auditable, and aligned with clinical guidelines and regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, we goal is to provide a seamless and intuitive assistance tool that enhances the work of hospital staff, allowing hospital staff to focus on delivering high-quality patient care while reducing administrative burdens." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How will we ensure that a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure meets these sustainability requirements, and what measures can we propose to reduce the environmental impact of a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure? we can meet The client sustainability requirements by proposing a solution that leverages we green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is based in the EU and uses renewable energy. proposing will help reduce the carbon footprint associated with we infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can implement digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching to minimize energy consumption.  we can also provide the client with a deployment footprint report, allowing the client to track the environmental impact of the client solution. we ability to conduct a bilan carbone and publish a trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year demonstrates we commitment to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we sovereign European model self-hosted capability ensures that data is stored and processed within the EU, reducing the need for long-distance data transfers and associated energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure, the client can benefit from a reduced environmental footprint while still meeting the client information system needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) can rely on our consortium to design, implement, and deploy an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety. our proposed solution, built on our Atelier platform, will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff existing work environment, supporting clinical-administrative activities such as information retrieval, drafting medical and administrative documents, handling dossiers, and ensuring continuity of care between professionals and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, our will deploy an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider that is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and operates only within the EU using renewable power." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures data sovereignty, GDPR compliance, and high availability, with an expected response time below 2 seconds for common queries and an availability target of 99.9 percent. our API-first design supports integration with the client's existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), as well as health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR. an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety will provide explainable and traceable recommendations, grounded in the organisation's own validated documents, ensuring that all decisions can be reviewed and validated by an authorised professional. our guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, medical confidentiality, and HDS certification requirements, using encryption (TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest) and pseudonymisation where applicable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure, our will leverage OuraneCloud green hosting capabilities and implement digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching. our will also provide the client with a deployment footprint report, allowing the client to track the environmental impact of the client solution. our pricing model is designed to ensure cost optimisation, with a target gross margin percentage ranging from 25 to 35 percent. our propose using the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which have been noted to be more cost-efficient on the recurring side. our total budget for the project is estimated at €900,000 over 5 years, with one-off project costs accounting for 30 percent (€270,000) and recurring run costs making up 70 percent (€630,000). our approach prioritises innovation, sovereignty, and human oversight, ensuring that our AI components are transparent, auditable, and aligned with clinical guidelines and regulatory requirements. our will work closely with the client's experts to tailor an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety to the client's specific needs, using an iterative approach involving corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) can benefit from a seamless and intuitive assistance tool that enhances the work of hospital staff, allowing hospital staff to focus on delivering high-quality patient care while reducing administrative burdens. our commitment to data sovereignty, GDPR compliance, and sustainability ensures that an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety meets the client's requirements while minimizing an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities, improving efficiency, quality of care, and patient safety environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
